---------------------- OPTIONS -----------------------------------------
0.2e-3   dtM       - time step to use in mooring integration (s)
243.3    WtrDpth   - water depth (m) <<< must be specified for farm-level mooring
3.0e6    kbot      - bottom stiffness (Pa/m)
3.0e5    cbot      - bottom damping (Pa-s/m)
0.1      dtIC      - time interval for analyzing convergence during IC gen (s)
100.0    TmaxIC    - max time for ic gen (s)
4.0      CdScaleIC - factor by which to scale drag coefficients during dynamic relaxation (-)
0.001    threshIC  - threshold for IC convergence (-)                    
